    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=1600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into darkness. Every death leaves a mark.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEKRO3</strong> is a dark 2D <strong>horror-puzzle</strong> game with <strong>stealth elements</strong>.<br>You are terminally ill. Somewhere in the depths lies a stone that can heal.<br>But the deeper you go, the more you die. And every death becomes your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is a mechanic</strong> <br>Each time you die, your glowing corpse stays behind. It can come back \u2014 as a zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are your own worst enemy</strong> <br>A unique foe \u2014 a negative version of yourself \u2014 hunts your reanimated bodies and wants to take your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No weapons. Only traps</strong> <br>Outsmart enemies using the environment. Survive through trickery, not violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong> <br>Zombies follow light, shadows lurk in darkness, and some creatures only move when unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitches and distortions</strong> <br>Visual glitches, red flashes, audio corruption \u2014 fear is woven into the interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=1070 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 unique levels</strong> <br>From puzzles and false exits to moments where <i>you</i> become the zombie.\u00a0Inspired by Level Devil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/62bb9620e95dca4a129dbb1ef9379450.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/62bb9620e95dca4a129dbb1ef9379450.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/62bb9620e95dca4a129dbb1ef9379450.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist and grim</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <strong>Lone Survivor</strong>,\u00a0<strong>LIMBO</strong><br>Short, intense experience: <strong>1.5\u20133 hours</strong> on your first playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Who is this for?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>experimental horror</strong> with unique mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>non-combat stealth</strong> gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anyone interested in games that explore <strong>death as a theme</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEKRO3 isn\u2019t just a game. It\u2019s a descent into darkness \u2014 and a search for light.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was created during my battle with a serious illness.<br>It\u2019s a personal story \u2014 about fear, acceptance, and the search for healing \u2014 told through gameplay.<br>If <strong>LIMBO</strong> is about a boy in hell, <strong>NEKRO3</strong> is about the hell inside.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=1600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/2d033e827e9f811ec4737760c8e7abac.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Descend into darkness. Every death leaves a mark.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEKRO3</strong> is a dark 2D <strong>horror-puzzle</strong> game with <strong>stealth elements</strong>.<br>You are terminally ill. Somewhere in the depths lies a stone that can heal.<br>But the deeper you go, the more you die. And every death becomes your enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/c0d6c015d962eb640341a232e27cf84a.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Death is a mechanic</strong> <br>Each time you die, your glowing corpse stays behind. It can come back \u2014 as a zombie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/b22d8e48de80b76d8148a9ddd2fa8bd5.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are your own worst enemy</strong> <br>A unique foe \u2014 a negative version of yourself \u2014 hunts your reanimated bodies and wants to take your place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/e7ace37922f17e8144ea23b2ba0eb6d6.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No weapons. Only traps</strong> <br>Outsmart enemies using the environment. Survive through trickery, not violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple enemy types</strong> <br>Zombies follow light, shadows lurk in darkness, and some creatures only move when unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/4290283fec4ea611e568d75035976b9e.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glitches and distortions</strong> <br>Visual glitches, red flashes, audio corruption \u2014 fear is woven into the interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=1070 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/a1e7b2271c6804f62c97067be065adc7.mp4?t=1755354666\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15 unique levels</strong> <br>From puzzles and false exits to moments where <i>you</i> become the zombie.\u00a0Inspired by Level Devil</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/62bb9620e95dca4a129dbb1ef9379450.poster.avif?t=1755354666\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3776350/extras/62bb9620e95dca4a129dbb1ef9379450.webm?t=1755354666\" type=\"